1
00:00:00,662 --> 00:00:04,152
(Sheldon:)...is because I have to attend a memorial
service for Professor Tupperman.

2
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:07,400
- That sounds like a long and tedious evening.
- Ah, it will be.

3
00:00:07,602 --> 00:00:10,262
(Sheldon:)Honestly, if I must endure
a long and tedious evening...

4
00:00:10,505 --> 00:00:12,995
(Sheldon:)...I'd rather it be with you on date night.

5
00:00:14,609 --> 00:00:17,579
(Sheldon:)But I have no choice.
The tenure committee is going to be there.

6
00:00:17,779 --> 00:00:20,509
(Amy:)Oh, well, in that case,
perhaps I should come along.

7
00:00:21,016 --> 00:00:23,246
(Sheldon:)Now that I think about it,
that would be helpful.

8
00:00:23,485 --> 00:00:24,505
(Amy:)Of course it would.

9
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:28,350
I'm well versed in academic politics,
and as a respected scientist...

10
00:00:28,557 --> 00:00:30,927
(Amy:)...I can only raise your stock
as a candidate.

11
00:00:31,126 --> 00:00:33,356
(Sheldon:)Actually, I meant you could drive me.

12
00:00:36,098 --> 00:00:38,858
(Sheldon:)But if it makes you happy,
that other stuff too.

13
00:00:43,004 --> 00:00:47,404
- Do anything interesting today?
- Not really. I was out shopping with Amy.

14
00:00:47,609 --> 00:00:50,309
(Penny:)She wanted me to help her find something
for this memorial.

15
00:00:50,545 --> 00:00:53,815
What, Sheldon's going to be there?
We all promised we weren't gonna go.

16
00:00:53,982 --> 00:00:56,142
- Oh. What ajerk.
- I know.

17
00:00:56,384 --> 00:01:00,024
(Leonard:)I was hoping to go
without anyone finding out.

